030/extras/tutorythighs.png?t=1748937713\" /></div> Keep in mind, if you make some very bad choices, the fight can end worse than just a small loss to your record. Remember, in the underground fighting community, there are no rules or guidelines to follow. It might be over for you before you even realize what hit you.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920030/extras/characters.png?t=1748937713\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920030/extras/tutory.png?t=1748937713\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920030/extras/katsumi.png?t=1748937713\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920030/extras/mila.png?t=1748937713\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920030/extras/ayaka.png?t=1748937713\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIDE CHARACTERS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Itaiero</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuyumi, Kado, Denki </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ATTENTION: ALL CHARACTERS IN THIS GAME ARE OVER THE AGE OF 20!!! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920030/extras/features.png?t=1748937713\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a femdom 2D Visual Novel with Action elements, UnderGirl: SP features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Complete storyli